    {
      "text": "你提供的矩阵状态是原始整数 UMI 计数，符合 scVI 对原始计数输入的要求。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": [
        "user:matrix_state"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "scVI 支持批次整合任务，但该支持不构成任何比较性优势。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 2,
          "quote": "The original scVI model explicitly supports batch integration. No comparative superiority is asserted."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "scVI 支持低维表示任务，但该支持不构成任何比较性优势。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 3,
          "quote": "The original scVI model explicitly supports dimensionality reduction. No comparative superiority is asserted."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "模型在批次注释可用时会以批次注释为条件；你提供的 batch_key=donor 可作为批次注释使用。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
